// D-JPK-TOOLCHAIN1=A (#179, U30): the toolchain is a dependency. The `jet:`
// field pins WHICH Jet compiler builds this project — a channel ref, resolved
// to an exact version in `.jet/lock`. A `jet` in the pinned channel builds it
// natively (as here); a `jet` from a different series realizes the pinned
// compiler as a prebuilt hangar object and re-execs into it (never a source
// build). This is a different concept from a Rust `extern rust` build
// toolchain (D-JPK-BUILDTOOL1).
name:    "toolchain_pin_demo"
version: "0.1.0"
edition: "2026"
// Pin the toolchain to a channel. `jet init` writes this line by default,
// so a project is reproducible from birth. `jet self toolchain` shows the pin
// and its locked exact version; `jet update jet <channel>` moves it.
jet:     1.0
